1. GRANT OF LICENSE

   Subscriber to the terms below receives a limited, personal,
   non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable license to run Better
   Brush on their own equipment for the permitted use described in the
   "EDITIONS" section.

2. EDITIONS

   a) Lite (free).  Anyone may use the Lite edition. Lite includes full
      masking, keyframing and propagation, PNG alpha export, H.264 MP4
      export up to 1920×1080 with chroma-key backgrounds, and a small
      "Better Brush" watermark on video exports.

   b) Pro (paid).  A Pro activation key unlocks: exports made with the
      ProRes and QuickTime Animation codecs (MOV with alpha), resolutions
      beyond 1920×1080, muxing of the original video's audio track, Library
      recoding, and export without the Lite watermark.

   The purchase of a Pro key covers one (1) installation. Distributing,
      sharing, publishing or reselling Pro keys is prohibited.

3. ACTIVATION KEYS

   Pro keys are issued by Sneg and are unique to the licensee named in the
   key. Keys may optionally have an expiry date. Activity checks are
   performed entirely offline; no data is transmitted.

